.el .ds Aq '
.TH sam-jail-logs 1 2026-11-10 "SAM 0.1.0" "SAM Manual"
.SH NAME
sam\-jail\-logs \- Show logs for an app
.SH SYNOPSIS
\fBsam\-jail logs\fR [\fB\-\-kind\fR] [\fB\-\-list\fR] [\fB\-\-file\fR] [\fB\-\-tail\fR] [\fB\-h\fR|\fB\-\-help\fR] <\fIAPP\fR> 
.SH DESCRIPTION
Show logs for an app
.SH OPTIONS
.TP
\fB\-\-kind\fR \fI<KIND>\fR
launch, extract, detect or diagnose
.TP
\fB\-\-list\fR
List log files instead of printing the latest
.TP
\fB\-\-file\fR \fI<FILE>\fR
Print this log file (one of `\-\-list`) instead of the latest
.TP
\fB\-\-tail\fR \fI<TAIL>\fR [default: 200]

.TP
\fB\-h\fR, \fB\-\-help\fR
Print help
.TP
<\fIAPP\fR>

